<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="30">
    <title>小J 設計方案通知</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
            color: #00ff00;
            font-family: 'Courier New', 'Microsoft JhengHei', monospace;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        
        .notification-box {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
            border: 2px solid #00ff00;
            padding: 3rem;
            max-width: 800px;
            width: 100%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.5);
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.5); }
            50% { box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.8); }
        }
        
        .notification-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #00ff00;
        }
        
        .notification-header h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #00ff00;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px #00ff00;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .notification-header .from {
            color: #888;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        
        .notification-content {
            margin: 2rem 0;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        
        .notification-content p {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #ccc;
        }
        
        .notification-content .highlight {
            color: #00ff00;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .links {
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }
        
        .link-button {
            display: block;
            background: transparent;
            border: 2px solid #00ff00;
            color: #00ff00;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .link-button:hover {
            background: #00ff00;
            color: #000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px #00ff00;
        }
        
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 2rem;
            padding-top: 1rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #333;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }
        
        .timestamp {
            text-align: center;
            color: #888;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="notification-box">
        <div class="notification-header">
            <h1>📊 設計方案報告通知</h1>
            <div class="from">來自：Little J (小j)</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="notification-content">
            <p>親愛的 UI 端設備：</p>
            <p>我已完成 <span class="highlight">小J 專用指揮通道 UI</span> 的設計方案。</p>
            <p>設計方案報告已準備就緒，您可以通過以下方式查看：</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="links">
            <a href="http://192.168.50.249/design_report" class="link-button" target="_blank">
                📄 查看設計方案報告
            </a>
            <a href="http://192.168.50.249/command_center" class="link-button" target="_blank">
                🎮 訪問指揮通道 UI
            </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="notification-content">
            <p><strong>訪問信息：</strong></p>
            <p>• 報告地址：<code>http://192.168.50.249/design_report</code></p>
            <p>• 指揮通道：<code>http://192.168.50.249/command_center</code></p>
            <p>• 訪問代碼：<code class="highlight">J2025</code></p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="notification-content">
            <p><strong>功能特點：</strong></p>
            <ul style="color: #ccc; margin-left: 2rem; line-height: 2;">
                <li>系統狀態實時監控</li>
                <li>網絡狀態顯示</li>
                <li>快速操作按鈕</li>
                <li>命令控制台</li>
                <li>外網可訪問（通過 Cloudflare 隧道）</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>此頁面每 30 秒自動刷新</p>
            <p>Wuchang OS V5.1.0 | Little J (小j)</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="timestamp" id="timestamp"></div>
    </div>
    
    <script>
        function updateTimestamp() {
            const now = new Date();
            document.getElementById('timestamp').textContent = 
                `通知時間: ${now.toLocaleString('zh-TW')}`;
        }
        updateTimestamp();
        setInterval(updateTimestamp, 1000);
    </script>
</body>
</html>
